---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '../consts';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About Penpixel Creative | AI Visibility Consultancy for B2B SaaS"
  description="Penpixel Creative is an AI visibility consultancy that helps B2B SaaS companies become more discoverable, understandable, and recommendable in AI search."
>
  <main>
    <section class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 pt-20 pb-16 md:pt-28">
      <p class="font-mono text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-impact">// about Penpixel Creative</p>
      <h1 class="mt-5 max-w-4xl text-5xl md:text-6xl">We Build the Digital Foundation AI Trusts.</h1>
      <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-lg text-canvas/80">
        Penpixel Creative is an AI visibility consultancy that helps B2B SaaS companies become
        more discoverable, understandable, and recommendable in AI search. We optimize the brand
        signals, structure, and content that AI systems use to understand and evaluate companies.
      </p>
      <p class="mt-4 max-w-2xl text-lg text-canvas/80">
        We started in SEO. We're not stuck there.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="border-t border-white/10">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-20">
        <h2 class="max-w-3xl text-3xl md:text-4xl">Visibility is a commodity. Authority is the asset.</h2>
        <div class="mt-8 grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2">
          <p class="text-canvas/70">Keyword rankings mean little when it's AI that determines whether your brand gets seen. The critical question is whether AI trusts your brand enough to recommend and include it in its answers.</p>
          <p class="text-canvas/70">Consistent brand signals, structured data, site architecture, and content help AI systems understand your brand and decide when to recommend it. It's more than marketing copy. It's the foundation of AI visibility. That's what we do.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="border-t border-white/10">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-20">
        <p class="font-mono text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-canvas/50">// our approach</p>
        <h2 class="mt-5 max-w-3xl text-3xl md:text-4xl">We diagnose before we prescribe.</h2>
        <p class="mt-6 max-w-2xl text-canvas/70">
          No retainer-first pitch. No guesswork. We start with a diagnosis: a clear read of where
          AI fails to find, understand, or accurately represent your brand, followed by a
          prescription for what needs to change. We ensure you understand the problem before
          committing to a solution.
        </p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="border-t border-white/10">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-20">
        <p class="font-mono text-sm uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-canvas/50">// Penpixel Creative team</p>
        <h2 class="mt-5 text-3xl md:text-4xl">The people behind the work.</h2>
        <div class="mt-10 grid gap-10 md:grid-cols-2">
          <article id="deven-bhagwandin">
            <img src="/images/deven-bhagwandin.webp" alt="Deven Bhagwandin, Founder of Penpixel Creative" width="640" height="777" loading="lazy" class="w-full max-w-xs" />
            <p class="mt-5 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-impact">The Technical Strategist</p>
            <h3 class="mt-2 text-xl">{SITE.founder}</h3>
            <p class="font-display text-sm font-bold text-canvas/80">Strategic Vision. AI Visibility.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-canvas/70">
              Deven leads Penpixel Creative&rsquo;s strategic direction, helping B2B SaaS companies
              adapt their digital presence for AI search and recommendations. His background in
              executive consulting and digital communications helps business leaders navigate the
              shift from traditional SEO to AI visibility.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-canvas/70">
              An expert in Generative AI and prompt engineering, Deven focuses on how AI systems
              understand, evaluate, and recommend brands. He helps B2B companies strengthen the
              content, structure, and brand signals that shape how AI understands and surfaces
              their brands.
            </p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <img src="/images/tony-moles.webp" alt="Tony Moles, Creative Director at Penpixel Creative" width="640" height="777" loading="lazy" class="w-full max-w-xs" />
            <p class="mt-5 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-success">The Creative Director</p>
            <h3 class="mt-2 text-xl">Tony Moles</h3>
            <p class="font-display text-sm font-bold text-canvas/80">Visual Strategy. Creative Direction.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-canvas/70">
              Tony leads creative direction at Penpixel Creative, bringing extensive experience in
              B2B agency environments. He builds brand identities that communicate credibility,
              authority, and consistency across digital channels.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-canvas/70">
              His work strengthens the visual signals that support brand recognition and AI
              visibility.
            </p>
          </article>
          <article>
            <img src="/images/patrick-mcdonough.webp" alt="Patrick McDonough, The Growth Architect at Penpixel Creative" width="640" height="777" loading="lazy" class="w-full max-w-xs" />
            <p class="mt-5 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-ai">The Growth Architect</p>
            <h3 class="mt-2 text-xl">Patrick McDonough</h3>
            <p class="font-display text-sm font-bold text-canvas/80">Entrepreneurial Strategy. Commercial Growth.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-canvas/70">
              Patrick brings a founder&rsquo;s perspective to marketing strategy and execution. He
              has founded multiple multi-million-dollar companies and developed marketing programs
              for hundreds of organizations.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-canvas/70">
              At Penpixel Creative, Patrick connects AI visibility to business growth, ensuring
              every strategy supports measurable, scalable results.
            </p>
          </article>
          <article id="matt-shaw">
            <img src="/images/matt-shaw.webp" alt="Matt Shaw, The Infrastructure Architect at Penpixel Creative" width="640" height="777" loading="lazy" class="w-full max-w-xs" />
            <p class="mt-5 font-mono text-xs uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-infra">The Infrastructure Architect</p>
            <h3 class="mt-2 text-xl">Matt Shaw</h3>
            <p class="font-display text-sm font-bold text-canvas/80">Technical Precision. Verifiable Proof.</p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-canvas/70">
              Matt brings a systems engineer&rsquo;s discipline to AI visibility. His background in
              cloud architecture and DevOps engineering supports the technical systems behind
              schema, citation tracking, and reporting.
            </p>
            <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-canvas/70">
              At Penpixel Creative, Matt builds the systems that make your brand&rsquo;s AI
              visibility measurable and verifiable.
            </p>
          </article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="border-t border-white/10">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-24">
        <h2 class="max-w-3xl text-4xl md:text-5xl">See where you stand.</h2>
        <a href="/contact" class="mt-8 inline-block bg-impact-bg px-8 py-4 font-display text-lg font-bold text-canvas transition-opacity hover:opacity-90">Get the Diagnosis</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
